  "details": "# Issue:\nIf someone is typing while their original message is still up you will see the the typing indicator right next  to the already written text. (see attachments) This is not so pleasing to the eye, is harder to notice and makes the text box unnecessarily longer.\n# Suggestion:\nMove the typing indicator below the already written text. That way it's easier to notice when someone is typing and it's also more symmetric.\n# Attachments:\nOn the first picture you can see it's current placement and on the second one you can see where I think it would fit in better.",
